[[{"id":31254724281,"node_id":"LE_lADOAgUK288AAAABRmkOb88AAAAHRu0-uQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/events/31254724281","actor":{"login":"payalbisen-svg","id":287634290,"node_id":"U_kgDOESTzcg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287634290?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/payalbisen-svg","html_url":"https://github.com/payalbisen-svg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/payalbisen-svg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/payalbisen-svg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/payalbisen-svg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/payalbisen-svg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/payalbisen-svg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/payalbisen-svg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/payalbisen-svg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/payalbisen-svg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/payalbisen-svg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-09-16T15:03:11Z","label":{"name":"kind:bug","color":"fc2929"},"intent":null,"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":31254724570,"node_id":"LE_lADOAgUK288AAAABRmkOb88AAAAHRu0_2g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/events/31254724570","actor":{"login":"payalbisen-svg","id":287634290,"node_id":"U_kgDOESTzcg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287634290?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/payalbisen-svg","html_url":"https://github.com/payalbisen-svg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/payalbisen-svg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/payalbisen-svg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/payalbisen-svg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/payalbisen-svg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/payalbisen-svg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/payalbisen-svg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/payalbisen-svg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/payalbisen-svg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/payalbisen-svg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-09-16T15:03:11Z","label":{"name":"needs-triage","color":"b60205"},"intent":null,"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/5701444611","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/issues/73248#issuecomment-5701444611","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/73248","id":5701444611,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAgUK288AAAABU9UkAw","user":{"login":"iharshlalakiya","id":118156560,"node_id":"U_kgDOBwrtEA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118156560?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iharshlalakiya","html_url":"https://github.com/iharshlalakiya","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iharshlalakiya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iharshlalakiya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iharshlalakiya/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iharshlalakiya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iharshlalakiya/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iharshlalakiya/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iharshlalakiya/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iharshlalakiya/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iharshlalakiya/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-16T17:08:21Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T17:08:54Z","body":"Confirmed - the failing step is the single `ALTER TABLE xcom ALTER COLUMN value TYPE JSONB` in migration 0049. It's one atomic statement, so one unconvertible row aborts the whole migration.\n\nOne correction: the 268435455-byte cap is on the *elements* of a jsonb array/object, not on the value as a whole. A top-level jsonb string isn't subject to it (the 1 GB varlena limit applies instead), and jsonb can be larger than the text it came from, so a big array of small numbers can be under 268435455 as `bytea` and still fail. `octet_length(value) > 268435455` finds candidates but is neither necessary nor sufficient.\n\nProposed fix the archive-and-continue option from the description:\n\n- Move unconvertible values into the existing `_xcom_archive` table that 0049 already creates for the pickled rows, so no new table is needed, and let the migration proceed.\n- Decide per row by trying the actual cast in a `pg_temp` function rather than filtering on size, for the reason above. A cheap `octet_length` screen keeps that probe off rows that can't be affected.\n- Print the `dag_id`/`task_id`/`run_id`/`key` of everything archived, so the list is available either way.\n- PostgreSQL only — MySQL and SQLite use generic JSON and have no equivalent cap.\n\nDoes this look like the right direction, particularly amending a released migration in place? Open to a different approach if maintainers prefer fail-early instead. Happy to take this on, could it be assigned to me?\n\nAlso: this is `airflow-core/src/airflow/migrations/`, not Providers - worth recategorising.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/5701444611/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"iharshlalakiya","id":118156560,"node_id":"U_kgDO